{{also|Baby}}
==English==

===Etymology===
{{multiple images
|direction = vertical
|image1 = Baby.jpg
|caption1 = A human baby
|image2 = Baby ginger monkey.jpg
|caption2 = A baby [[monkey#Noun|monkey]]
|image3 = Smaller Babyelephant45 from wiki commons.jpg
|caption3 = A baby [[elephant]] (sometimes called a [[calf]])
}}

From {{inh|en|enm|baby}}, {{m|enm|babie|t=baby}}, a diminutive form of {{m|enm|babe|t=babe, baby}}, equivalent to {{suf|en|babe|y|alt2=y/-ie|t2=endearing and diminutive suffix|id2=diminutive}}. Perhaps ultimately imitative of baby talk (compare {{m|en|babble}}). <ref>{{R:Etymonline|babe}}</ref>

